title: Hospital
---
<<walk "lil lona live2D" LonaSpot>>>>
Lona: Whoa…
<<wait 1>>
<<hide Jason>>
<<show JasonHospital>>
<<walk JasonHospital JasonSpot>>
Jason: Lona?
Jason: I think you forgot how to play this game.
Jason: …Oh.
Lona: Do you think they still have patients?
Jason: What?
Lona: Here. In the hospital.
Jason: Lona, look at it.
Lona: I'm looking at it.
Jason: It looks like it hasn't had a patient since forever ago.
Lona: Maybe the ghosts are still in there..
Jason: Okay, that'd actually be pretty cool.
Lona: Right?
Jason: Wait. You're not actually going in, are you?
Lona: Why wouldn't I?
Jason: Because it's a building in the middle of nowhere.
Lona: Maybe that's why it's here.
Jason: …What does that even mean?
Lona: I don't know yet.
Lona: That's the point.
Jason: What if there's, like, a dead body in there?
Lona: Then we found a dead body.
Jason: You make everything sound so easy.
Lona: It probably won't be easy. The door looks stuck.
Lona: See?
Jason: That's… good, actually.
Lona: Help me.
Jason: Why me?
Lona: Because you're standing there.
Jason: You know, we could just go home and tell people we found a creepy hospital.
Lona: And then what?
Jason: I don't know. Eat dinner?
Lona: That's the saddest idea I've ever heard.
Jason: You're unbelievable.
<<wait 2>>
Jason: …That was probably a pipe.
Lona: You're scared.
Jason: I'm thinking.
Lona: You think with your whole face.
Jason: Can you not?
Jason: …If something grabs me, I'm blaming you.
Lona: Fair.
Lona: C'mon, then.
<<wait 1>>
Jason: …Don't tell anyone.
Lona: I'm telling everyone.
Jason: Lona!
